WEBVTT

00:12:56.458 --> 00:13:00.059
And we hope that the way
that we show up for Sekou

00:13:00.083 --> 00:13:01.351
and for each other

00:13:01.375 --> 00:13:05.101
is a model of what successful
co-parenting can look like.

00:13:05.125 --> 00:13:08.809
We'd like to bring you all in
to this nightly ritual of affirmations

00:13:08.833 --> 00:13:12.250
that Shaka does with Sekou
every night at bedtime.

00:13:14.958 --> 00:13:16.226
SS: Hey.

00:13:16.250 --> 00:13:21.792
(Applause)

00:13:23.625 --> 00:13:25.309
SS: I am great.
Sekou: I am great.

00:13:25.333 --> 00:13:27.143
SS: I am awesome.
Sekou: I am awesome.

00:13:27.167 --> 00:13:28.893
SS: I'm amazing.
Sekou: I'm amazing.

00:13:28.917 --> 00:13:30.976
SS: I am thoughtful.
Sekou: I am thoughtful.